    You can also accept some user ids  `adobeid:...`, `urn:ab:...` as well 
    to identify the users.

    **WARNING:** before any invitation API call, the user must explicitly
    confirm the exact invite details returned by this tool after verification.
    Pass their exact words in `confirmationQuote` only when they clearly
